  "schema_note": "Version 3 moves tiers 24, 32 and 48 by the plain-decode lookahead: without the draft head it now runs from 20 experts per layer before its charge and reserves 373 MiB, about three experts per layer, so pool_slots, pool_gb, experts_per_layer_cached and est_warm_tok_s change there. Tier 16, at 19 experts per layer, keeps every version 2 value. Each tier now plans with --model at an absent directory so the charge never depends on an installed tap-correction file. The expected values come from doctor on the commit that made the change; baseline_binary_sha256 still names the 0.2.10 binary of the unchanged values. Additions declare mtp_streamed_experts. Versions 1 and 2 stay as historical fixtures; this version is also the library-default contract of Tools/context_proxy.swift."
